  "id": "see_you_at_the_worlds_end",
  "name": "See You at the World's End!",
  "desc": "The Aeon's magic act draws to a close, yet the lingering warmth of the miracle still reverberates across the universe.\nJust as it was thousands of Amber Eras ago, the \"Trailblaze\" and \"Elation\" stand side by side once more, and THEY shall part ways to forge ahead yet again.\n\nNo one knows what the future holds, but the promise remains unchanged.\n\"Got it! I'll scatter variables across the universe, creating a journey where the unknown and surprises go hand in hand~\"\nTHEIR silhouette vanishes into the cosmos, THEIR laughter drifting in the wind:\n\n\"Walk the path Akivili never finished, and then, see you at the World's End!\"",
  "rarity": 4,
  "pathType": "Elation",
  "pathTypeText": "Elation",
  "effectName": "Conspirator",
